# Build output. Note the trailing slash with no leading slash: this must match at EVERY level,
# not just the repository root. A leading-slash "/build" matches only the root and lets
# app/build/ and engine/build/ through — which stages the merged asset copies of the model
# weights, several hundred megabytes of them.
build/
.gradle/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
captures/

# IDE and local machine
.idea/
*.iml
local.properties
.DS_Store

# Model weights are NOT in git: ~459 MB of ONNX translation graphs plus the optional generative
# .task file. They are produced/downloaded out of band; see the README for how to stage them. A
# clone without them compiles and runs — translation is unavailable and the app falls back to its
# non-generative tutor, which is a supported configuration, not a broken one.
#
# Was ~909 MB. The Vosk acoustic models went with the unwired speech-input feature, and the HI->EN
# graphs are not packaged because nothing loads them; the model/ and model-hi/ entries below are
# kept so a stray re-stage does not get committed by accident.
*.onnx
*.ort
*.task
*.litertlm
engine/src/main/assets/*.bin
engine/src/main/assets/dict.*.json
engine/src/main/assets/model/
engine/src/main/assets/model-hi/

# Local measurement output from the on-device gates — machine-specific, not shared state.
/measurements/
